Cell["\<\
A graph does not determine its map. The smallest map {5, 5}, of genus 4, has \
the graph of the icosahedron, whose girth 3 reads as triangles and genus 0.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"3236cd6a-0f87-4136-84c4-1a7f7de8c0fb"],

