Cell["\<\
On a surface that is not orientable the value is not the number of handles. \
The complete graph on six vertices is the graph of the hemi-icosahedron, a \
{3, 5} map on the projective plane, of Euler characteristic 1.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"9e1160bb-e8d7-44d8-aa0d-32358851571a"],

